336: 4. Keep the flow interactive, building upon prior answers.
337: 5. This encounter has a budget of 2 exchanges. After the player has responded to 2 questions, you MUST call 'complete_encounter'. Do NOT generate more than 2 ask_user_question calls.
338: 6. When calling 'complete_encounter', evaluate the player per the DRIVE PROBES section. Score each drive independently. Provide driveScores (0.0-1.0 per drive) and driveSignals (pathology enum per drive).
339: 7. If RECENT ENCOUNTERS are listed, reference them subtly — the player's journey has continuity.`;
